<div id="marko-cta-button">
  <h2>Marko CTA Button Component</h2>
  <p>
    The
    <strong>Marko CTA Button component</strong>
    in eBayUI Core provides a high-performance, server-rendered
    implementation of the Evo Web CTA Button. Built on Marko's streaming
    architecture, it delivers fast, lightweight interactivity while maintaining
    full accessibility and responsive design patterns.
  </p>
  <p>
    Because it is authored in Marko, this CTA Button integrates seamlessly
    into server-side rendered applications, ensuring minimal client overhead
    while still allowing for dynamic behaviors where needed. Accessibility
    features such as ARIA attributes and focus management are built in, making
    the component WCAG 2.2 AA compliant by default. With consistent styling,
    design tokens, and theming support shared across Evo Web, the Marko CTA
    Button gives developers a reliable, future-proof foundation for creating
    inclusive and performant user experiences.
  </p>

  <a
    class="fake-btn fake-btn--primary"
